sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant API as Laravel
  participant DB as DB
  U->>FE: Compose post
  FE->>API: POST /api/Y/posts/create (multipart/json)
  API->>DB: Insert post + media
  DB-->>API: Post row
  API-->>FE: 201 { post }
  FE->>U: Render new post (optimistic add)